
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>星粒銀行 シルエット試着室</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,
  "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN",sans-serif;
  color:#374052;
  background:#f7f4ee;
}
main{
  max-width:650px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:24px 16px 50px;
}
h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px}
p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#777f8d}
.panel{
  background:#fff;
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:18px;
  box-shadow:0 5px 22px #27304713;
  margin:18px 0;
}
.controls{
  display:flex;
  gap:8px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin:12px 0;
}
button{
  border:1px solid #dddde5;
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:12px 15px;
  background:white;
  color:#667083;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:bold;
  cursor:pointer;
}
button.active{
  background:#fff0ca;
  color:#956e30;
  border-color:#d6b77b;
}
.stage{
  height:300px;
  border-radius:18px;
  overflow:hidden;
  position:relative;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  transition:background .5s;
}
.stage.day{
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#ffe8ad,#fff9e8);
}
.stage.night{
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#17213c,#40547e);
}
.stage svg{
  width:95%;
  max-width:460px;
  height:auto;
  overflow:visible;
}
.scene{display:none}
.scene.active{display:block}
.figure{fill:#363b48}
.cat{fill:#252a35}
.hair{
  stroke:#363b48;
  stroke-width:5;
  stroke-linecap:round;
  stroke-linejoin:round;
  fill:none;
}
.zig{
  fill:none;
  stroke:#f1d18d;
  stroke-width:5;
  stroke-linecap:round;
  stroke-linejoin:round;
}
.floor{
  fill:none;
  stroke:#ab997c;
  stroke-width:2.5;
  stroke-linecap:round;
}
.night .floor{stroke:#9eaed3}
.sky-star{fill:#e1b45d}
.night .sky-star{fill:#ebedff}
.caption{
  font-size:12px;
  text-align:center;
  color:#808a9a;
  margin-top:13px;
}
.small-note{
  padding:13px;
  background:#faf7f0;
  border-radius:12px;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.8;
  color:#717888;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main>
<h1>✦ 星粒銀行・シルエット試着室</h1>
<p>
ここはデザイン確認専用。
星粒銀行の残高や履歴には一切触れないよ。
</p>

